      en: ["Oil field discovered in 1970", "Operated by Myanma Oil and Gas Enterprise (MOGE)", "Located in the Magway Region near Minbu", "Key onshore site for crude oil and natural gas", "Employs EOR techniques to boost output", "Primary source of crude oil for local refineries"],
